<title>UK: Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 44.2 cargoes in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 44.2 cargoes in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system is due to load the equivalent of 44.2 standard cargoes of 500,000 barrels each in May, traders said.  </p>
<p>They said the programme consisted of 23 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, nine cargoes of 500,000 barrels and one cargo each of 1.8 million and two million barrels, totalling 34 actual loadings.</p>
<p>The Oseberg system was scheduled to load the equivalent of 42.2 standard 500,000-barrel stems in April, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
